WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.331 --> 00:00:06.530
Today's One Minute Monday is: "Scare yourself."

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.126
This morning I reached out to an old buddy of mine named George,

00:00:09.126 --> 00:00:12.221
who used to help out a lot in the Salsa classes I had him.

00:00:12.221 --> 00:00:14.895
And he hasn't helped for 3 years because he hurt his shoulder and I said:

00:00:14.895 --> 00:00:18.626
"George, I'm putting on a class. I really want you to come out and help out,

00:00:18.626 --> 00:00:20.172
I think it'd be a lot of fun.

00:00:20.172 --> 00:00:22.244
I miss you, it'd be great to see you again."

00:00:22.244 --> 00:00:25.106
And he said: "Thanks so much for reaching out. You know what? I'd love to,

00:00:25.106 --> 00:00:28.876
but I'm really scared. I haven't danced in 3 years."

00:00:28.876 --> 00:00:31.812
I said: "George, you've got to do something to scare yourself each day, right?"

00:00:31.812 --> 00:00:34.496
And he said: "You know what? Thanks for the kick in the pants, I'll come out."

00:00:34.496 --> 00:00:38.624
So, for today, I want you to scare yourself.

00:00:38.624 --> 00:00:43.033
Do one thing, just today that you have this limiting self-belief about,

00:00:43.033 --> 00:00:44.806
that you're holding yourself back on.

00:00:44.806 --> 00:00:50.792
Do one thing today that scares you a little bit. Maybe it's reaching out to somebody who you never...

00:00:50.792 --> 00:00:53.664
thought would return your phone call. Maybe it's emailing somebody.

00:00:53.664 --> 00:00:55.355
Maybe it's saying "yes" to a meeting.

00:00:55.355 --> 00:01:01.912
Something! Think of something that you really want, that in your ideal world exists...

00:01:01.912 --> 00:01:05.559
but you're too afraid to go out and ask for.

00:01:05.559 --> 00:01:09.571
And just for today, step outside your comfort zone and go for it!

00:01:09.571 --> 00:01:13.593
It'll make you a stronger and better person. And you never know what will happen.

00:01:13.593 --> 00:01:15.145
Believe!

00:01:15.145 --> 00:01:17.281
If you guys liked this video, thumbs up below.

00:01:17.281 --> 00:01:19.167
Leave a comment, let me know what you think.

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:21.664
Let me know what you're going to do today that scares you.

00:01:21.664 --> 00:01:23.466
And click on my face, subscribe to the channel.

00:01:23.466 --> 00:01:25.359
Thank you, guys. I'll see you soon.

